JET (fluid-engine-dev)
======================

Vendored from https://github.com/doyubkim/fluid-engine-dev (MIT).

Do **not** ``add_subdirectory`` this folder from Blender. The upstream
CMakeLists.txt builds gtest, python bindings and examples.

Blender compiles ``src/jet/*.cpp`` from ``extern/apic/CMakeLists.txt``
and calls ``ApicSolver3`` / ``FlipSolver3`` through ``extern/apic``.
